he volume","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s960","en":"The simple wooden chair seems to epitomise her practical design philosophy.","zh":"这把简洁的木椅似乎集中体现了她务实的设计理念。","note":"epitomise · 集中体现； 概括 · epitomise a style","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s961","en":"Each guideline includes an example to help new volunteers.","zh":"每条指导原则都附有例子，帮助新志愿者理解。","note":"guideline · 指导方针，指导原则 · follow a guideline","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s962","en":"The greenhouse recreates a subtropical climate for its rare plants.","zh":"温室为珍稀植物模拟了亚热带气候。","note":"subtropical · 亚热带的 · a subtropical climate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s963","en":"A loose screw made the table wobble whenever we wrote.","zh":"一颗松动的螺丝让桌子在我们写字时摇晃。","note":"loose · 松的； 散漫的； 不精确的 · a loose screw","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s964","en":"The exhibit explains the emergency ejection system in older aircraft.","zh":"展品解释了旧式飞机中的紧急弹射系统。","note":"ejection · 喷出； 排出物 · an ejection system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s965","en":"Archaeologists found a worked piece of flint near the river.","zh":"考古学家在河边发现了一块加工过的燧石。","note":"flint · 火石， 打火石 · a flint tool","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s966","en":"The mechanic checked the wheel alignment after replacing the tyre.","zh":"机修工换好轮胎后检查了车轮定位。","note":"alignment · 排成直线； 联盟 · wheel alignment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s967","en":"Sharing limited rehearsal space has become a thorny issue.","zh":"如何共用有限的排练空间已成为一个棘手问题。","note":"thorny · 多刺的； 痛苦的， 棘手的 · a thorny issue","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s968","en":"The documentary examines exploitative practices in parts of the clothing industry.","zh":"纪录片考察了服装行业部分领域的剥削行为。","note":"exploitative · 开发的， 利用的； 剥削的 · exploitative practices","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s969","en":"The painting belongs to a private collection outside London.","zh":"这幅画属于伦敦以外的一处私人收藏。","note":"private · 私人的； 私下的； 私立的 · a private collection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s970","en":"The venue provides technical support for visiting theatre groups.","zh":"场地为到访的剧团提供技术支持。","note":"technical · 技术的， 工艺的 · technical support","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s971","en":"My travelling companion suggested visiting the harbour before lunch.","zh":"我的旅伴建议午餐前去港口看看。","note":"companion · 共事者； 同伴 · a travelling companion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s972","en":"Months of rehearsal will culminate in a performance next Friday.","zh":"数月的排练将在下周五的演出中迎来高潮。","note":"culminate · 告终； 结束 · culminate in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s973","en":"The invoice provides a breakdown of materials and labour costs.","zh":"发票详细列出了材料和人工费用。","note":"breakdown · 垮台， 倒塌， 破裂； 衰竭， 衰弱； 损坏， 故障； 分类 · a detailed breakdown","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s974","en":"The play explores disharmony between neighbours sharing a crowded courtyard.","zh":"这部剧探讨了共用拥挤院落的邻居之间的不和。","note":"disharmony · 不一致； 不和谐 · social disharmony","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s975","en":"We walked along a quiet stretch of the coast.","zh":"我们沿着一段安静的海岸步行。","note":"stretch · 伸展；延伸，延续，拉长；使倾注全力，使紧张；一段； 伸展， 延伸， 延续 · a long stretch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s976","en":"The small team managed to accomplish everything before the deadline.","zh":"这个小团队设法在截止日期前完成了所有事情。","note":"accomplish · 达到， 完成， 实现 · accomplish a task","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s977","en":"A strand of hair had caught on her scarf.","zh":"她的一缕头发缠在了围巾上。","note":"strand · 股， 缕； 部分， 方面 · a strand of hair","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s978","en":"The diagram separates the machine into its constituent parts.","zh":"图示把机器拆分为各个组成部分。","note":"constituent · 组成的； 有宪法制定或修改权的；成分，要素；选区内的选民 · a constituent part","recordings":[]},