ublic forum","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s989","en":"The character treats honest advice with contempt throughout the novel.","zh":"整部小说中，这个人物都对诚恳的建议不屑一顾。","note":"contempt · 轻视， 鄙视， 不尊重； 蔑视 · treat with contempt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s990","en":"A line of fishing boats appeared on the horizon.","zh":"地平线上出现了一排渔船。","note":"horizon · 地平线； 范围； 眼界 · on the horizon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s991","en":"Quiet corners help create a comfortable learning environment.","zh":"安静的角落有助于营造舒适的学习环境。","note":"environment · 周围状况； 环境 · a learning environment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s992","en":"She would never betray the confidence of a close friend.","zh":"她绝不会辜负密友的信任。","note":"betray · 出卖， 泄露； 辜负； 流露情感 · betray confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s993","en":"The leaflet gives a freefone number for further information.","zh":"传单提供了一个免费电话号码，供人获取更多信息。","note":"freefone · 免费电话 · a freefone number","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s994","en":"Using recycled paper was a deliberate choice by the designers.","zh":"使用再生纸是设计师们有意作出的选择。","note":"deliberate · 故意的；深思熟虑的；从容不迫的[dɪ'lIbəreIt]；深思熟虑； 审议 · a deliberate choice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s995","en":"The children made each other swear to keep the surprise secret.","zh":"孩子们让彼此发誓要保守这个惊喜的秘密。","note":"swear · 宣； 诅咒 · swear to do","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s996","en":"A shaft of sunlight fell across the old wooden floor.","zh":"一束阳光落在旧木地板上。","note":"shaft · 轴， 柄， 杆； 矛柄， 把柄； 束， 光线； 竖井， 升降井 · a shaft of light","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s997","en":"Soft lighting helped create a relaxed atmosphere in the café.","zh":"柔和灯光帮助咖啡馆营造了轻松氛围。","note":"atmosphere · 大气； 气氛； 环境 · a relaxed atmosphere","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-07:s998","en":"The children used paper flowers to decorate the classroom.","zh"